{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What to expect of this demo?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is <i>not</i> a management game!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">D&amp;D-inspired visual novel. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30 minutes gameplay. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Casual drink mixing and quest building with a dash of challenge \u2013 a refinement of the original game\u2019s mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">LGBTQ+ positive representation. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Once Upon A Time...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You find yourself in a little, bleary portside town in the south-east of Phesoa. There, 36 years before the events of <i>Tavern Talk</i>, you dive into the role of the Tavernkeep, the owner of <i>The Drowsy Dragon</i>, a small quayside bar on the coast of Borkam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840060/extras/28d7944a0c9ef67dd1403cc341a662df.avif?t=1753171970\" alt=\"Showing the tavern The Drowsy Dragon from outside.\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You have a special ability, gifted by one of the Great Dragon Gods or acquired through wizardly hubris: Mixing magic drinks that can alter the fate of your guests\u2014be it mean mercenaries, savvy sailors or ambitious adventurers. Every guest, no matter who they are, has a place in your warm tavern by the seaside. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In <i>The Drowsy Dragon</i>, fate is not written in the stars, it is written in the menu! Mix unique drinks from a wide ensemble of magical potions\u2014but be aware: There is more than one solution!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840060/extras/2af39a02c763fcc2d28e81a5a614d176.poster.avif?t=1753171970\" aria-label=\"Showing the drink mixing nook where the special drinks are mixed.\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840060/extras/2af39a02c763fcc2d28e81a5a614d176.webm?t=1753171970\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840060/extras/2af39a02c763fcc2d28e81a5a614d176.mp4?t=1753171970\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you listen to stories brimming with the spirit of adventure, you sit within the cozy walls of your tavern and pick up rumors to turn them into quests. Some of them are old sailor\u2019s yarn, so sort them thoroughly before sticking them up the wall!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As you meet new and familiar faces, all seems well. Your establishment is flourishing and friendships are made. All until something starts brewing on the horizon, something that\u2019s going to twist your brightest dreams into your darkest nightmares.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840060/extras/c3f124cae6dc6ca7bb490d5e14bce495.avif?t=1753171970\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Content Warning</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Like in every good Pen &amp; Paper campaign, <i>Tavern Talk Stories: Dreamwalker</i> touches topics that may hit right in the feels. Please be aware that there will be mentions of death, grief and violence.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3840060?t=1753171970","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840060/78cee9a641c552b2924aa45b3a9b450f3200d138/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753171970","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840060/3f8ccb6356f1e2ca6561c6a8806129de1c55e899/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753171970","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840060/3f8ccb6356f1e2ca6561c6a8806129de1c55e899/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753171970","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">What to expect of this demo?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is <i>not</i> a management game!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">D&amp;D-inspired visual novel. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">30 minutes gameplay. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Casual drink mixing and quest building with a dash of challenge \u2013 a refinement of the original game\u2019s mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">LGBTQ+ positive representation. </p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Once Upon A Time...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You find yourself in a little, bleary portside town in the south-east of Phesoa. There, 36 years before the events of <i>Tavern Talk</i>, you dive into the role of the Tavernkeep, the owner of <i>The Drowsy Dragon</i>, a small quayside bar on the coast of Borkam.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3840060/extras/28d7944a0c9ef67dd140